---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import koreaMapSvg from '../assets/korea-map.svg?raw';

const stores = [
  { name: '구리갈매점', type: '직영 · 본점', url: null },
  { name: '별내점', type: '직영', url: 'https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/1192703168' },
  { name: '역삼점', type: '직영', url: 'https://map.naver.com/p/entry/place/1680652900' },
  { name: '다산정약용도서관점', type: '가맹 1호점', url: 'https://naver.me/5lf3Tsks' },
  { name: '수서점', type: '가맹 · 10월 말 오픈 예정', url: null },
  { name: '범표원두팩토리', type: '로스팅공장 · 원두 구매 가능', url: 'https://naver.me/FzsVjpZN' },
];
---

<Base title="소개" path="/about/" description="범표원두 소개: 20년 스페셜티 커피 로스터리">
  <article>
    <h1>소개</h1>
    <div class="content">
      <p>범표원두는 20년째 커피를 볶아온 스페셜티 커피 로스터리입니다.</p>
      <p>이 노트의 글은 모두 범표원두 대표가 직접 씁니다.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="channel-links">
      <a class="channel-btn" href="https://brand.naver.com/bumpyobeans" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9.5 12 3l9 6.5" /><path d="M5 9v11h14V9" /><path d="M9 20v-6h6v6" /></svg>
        <span>스마트스토어</span>
      </a>
      <a class="channel-btn" href="https://bumpyobeans.co.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M3 12h18" /><path d="M12 3c2.5 2.5 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.5-3.8 9c-2.5-2.5-3.8-5.7-3.8-9s1.3-6.5 3.8-9z" /></svg>
        <span>자사몰</span>
      </a>
      <a class="channel-btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/bumpyobeans/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" /><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" /><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" /></svg>
        <span>인스타그램</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="stores">
      <h2 class="stores-title">범표라떼 맛보기 지도</h2>
      <p class="stores-subtitle">직영 3곳 · 가맹 2곳 · 로스팅공장 1곳. 아직은 서울·경기에서만 만나요.</p>

      <div class="korea-map-wrap">
        <div class="korea-map-svg" set:html={koreaMapSvg} />
        <div class="korea-callout">
          <p class="korea-callout-title">서울 · 경기</p>
          <ul class="korea-callout-list">
            {stores.map((s) => (
              <li>
                {s.url ? (
                  <a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    {s.name} <span>{s.type}</span>
                  </a>
                ) : (
                  <span class="korea-callout-plain">{s.name} <span>{s.type}</span></span>
                )}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="stores-note">📍 범표원두팩토리(로스팅공장)에서도 원두를 직접 구매하실 수 있어요. 주변 제조업체의 납품 문의도 환영합니다.</p>
      <p class="stores-credit">지도: simplemaps.com</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
